{"id":"n72425-2-12","stage":0,"title":"학원 · 补习班","scene":"校园与学习","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n72425-2-12-1","ko":"유민 씨는 직업이 뭐예요?","zh":"裕敏小姐是做什么工作的呢？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"유민","meaning":"裕敏","explanation":"유민：裕敏","readings":[{"term":"유민","audio":"/audio/801e6fbf054693aba14c.mp3"}],"sources":[]},{"text":"씨는","meaning":"用于称呼或指称前面的人，表示尊敬。","explanation":"씨：用于称呼或指称前面的人，表示尊敬。；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"씨","audio":"/audio/c90eea3c6347f1e0f4d9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58145","senseId":"1","lemma":"씨","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"직업이","meaning":"职业","explanation":"직업：职业；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"직업","audio":"/audio/c9b556a731fbce64bcd4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"83178","senseId":"1","lemma":"직업","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"뭐예요?","meaning":"什么","explanation":"뭐：什么；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；예요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"뭐","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"84991","senseId":"1","lemma":"뭐","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"c90eea3c6347f1e0","term":"씨","zh":"用于称呼或指称前面的人，表示尊敬。","audio":"/audio/c90eea3c6347f1e0f4d9.mp3","entryId":"58145","definition":"用于称呼或指称前面的人，表示尊敬。","pronunciation":["씨"]},{"id":"c9b556a731fbce64","term":"직업","zh":"职业","audio":"/audio/c9b556a731fbce64bcd4.mp3","entryId":"83178","definition":"领报酬而从事的工作。","pronunciation":["지겁"]},{"id":"95b5c8cf1b249b7a","term":"뭐","zh":"什么","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3","entryId":"84991","definition":"指代不知道的事实或事物。","pronunciation":["뭐ː"]}],"audio":"/audio/4ece4368ed7f218363dc.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n72425-2-12-2","ko":"피아노 학원에서 아이들에게 피아노를 가르쳐요.","zh":"在钢琴培训班里教孩子们弹钢琴。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"피아노","meaning":"钢琴","explanation":"피아노：钢琴","readings":[{"term":"피아노","audio":"/audio/a42d6c6f1325fb230dd8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31505","senseId":"1","lemma":"피아노","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"학원에서","meaning":"补习班，培训班","explanation":"학원：补习班，培训班；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"학원","audio":"/audio/a34f3f1b2a44f15f7e22.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72425","senseId":"2","lemma":"학원","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"아이들에게","meaning":"小孩，孩子","explanation":"아이：小孩，孩子；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象。；에게：格助词，表示动作所涉及的人：“给、对、向”等。","readings":[{"term":"아이","audio":"/audio/c3d655375e7f3d0484eb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62843","senseId":"1","lemma":"아이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"피아노를","meaning":"钢琴","explanation":"피아노：钢琴；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"피아노","audio":"/audio/a42d6c6f1325fb230dd8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31505","senseId":"1","lemma":"피아노","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"가르쳐요.","meaning":"教，教授，传授","explanation":"가르치다：教，教授，传授；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"가르치다","audio":"/audio/b630a8848339bddb2b9f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62255","senseId":"1","lemma":"가르치다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"a42d6c6f1325fb23","term":"피아노","zh":"钢琴","audio":"/audio/a42d6c6f1325fb230dd8.mp3","entryId":"31505","definition":"用手指敲击黑色及白色键盘而发出声响的大型乐器。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"a34f3f1b2a44f15f","term":"학원","zh":"补习班，培训班","audio":"/audio/a34f3f1b2a44f15f7e22.mp3","entryId":"72425","definition":"招收学生并教授其知识、技术及艺术体育等的私立教育机关。","pronunciation":["하권"]},{"id":"c3d655375e7f3d04","term":"아이","zh":"小孩，孩子","audio":"/audio/c3d655375e7f3d0484eb.mp3","entryId":"62843","definition":"年纪小的人。","pronunciation":["아이"]},{"id":"b630a8848339bddb","term":"가르치다","zh":"教，教授，传授","audio":"/audio/b630a8848339bddb2b9f.mp3","entryId":"62255","definition":"说明知识或技术等，使熟知。","pronunciation":["가르치다"]}],"audio":"/audio/f1158923ddda3ea02601.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":1.26,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=72425","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"2","sou